            # Weather Analytics Project
            ## Part 2: Analysis and Insights

            This notebook analyzes the weather data collected in Part 1, identifying patterns, correlations, and generating insights about weather patterns across different cities.
          id: 453ac6ab32da46cba4d230266eb312c1
